        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3cb5ea9/morphoeval/math_kg_loops/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.yaml#L1-L79> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
